id: 7
hanzi: 舒适
pinyin: shū shì
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Adjective

meanings_summary:
  en: comfortable; cozy; snug; easeful
  es: cómodo; confortable; agradable; acogedor

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Adjective | Standard | providing physical ease, relaxation, or pleasant well-being | que produce bienestar físico, relajación o agrado | 舒适的环境 (comfortable environment)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 他不愿一辈子过着安逸舒适的生活，而是渴望驾驶帆船去探索未知的辽阔世界。 | Tā bú yuàn yíbèizi guò zhe ānyì shūshì de shēnghuó, ér shì kěwàng jiàshǐ fānchuán qù tànsuǒ wèizhī de liáokuò shìjiè. | Unwilling to spend a lifetime in easy, comfortable ease, he yearned to pilot a sailboat to explore the vast unknown world. | Negándose a pasar toda la vida en una existencia plácida y cómoda, ansiaba tripular un velero para explorar la inmensidad del mundo ignoto.
  #2 | 该度假酒店以符合人体工学的设计理念改造客房，为跨国商旅人士打造出极致舒适的休憩体验。 | Gāi dùjià jiǔdiàn yǐ fúhé réntǐ gōngxué de shèjì lǐniàn gǎizào kèfáng, wèi kuàguó shānglǚ rénshì dǎzào chū jízhì shūshì de xiūqì tǐyàn. | The resort hotel renovated guest rooms using ergonomic design concepts, crafting an intensely comfortable resting experience for international business travelers. | El complejo hotelero remodeló sus habitaciones con criterios ergonómicos, creando una experiencia de descanso de máximo confort para viajeros de negocios globales.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  舒适的生活 | comfortable life
  环境舒适 | comfortable environment
  感到舒适 | feel comfortable
